     1,
     "Nevermind, find the answer already.<div>I seems I had to wait long enough so that the window.Shiny.shinyapp object would be created.</div><div>I used this code:</div><div><br></div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">waitForElement();<br>function waitForElement(){<br>    if(typeof window.Shiny.shinyapp !== &quot;undefined&quot;){<br>        console.log(&quot;shinyapp found!&quot;);<br>        //variable exists, do what you want</blockquote></div>"
    ],
